      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i understand. i'll stick to the tyylenol. but the fever just won't budge even with the kid dose... it's still like 103. is there anything else i can mix with the tyylenol to help? like maybe a little bit of that aspirin or something else so he's not in so much pain? i'm really worried he's gonna get dehydrated or something if we don't get this fever down soon.",
